{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And he sees you and rejoices in his heart.</b> For Moses would say: How do I come into Aaron's domain — prophesying, as it is said ״הנגלה נגליתי״ etc. The Holy One, blessed be He, said to him: Why do you mention Aaron? He is not resentful — he rejoices. As it is said: ״ויאמר ה' אל אהרן לך לקראת משה״ — so that he [=Aaron] knows that you rejoice."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:02:39.891460251Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}